y observed, and good or bad luck may also affect it.\n\t\tYou estimate your current chance to maintain stealth as %0.1f%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target_preimage_sha256":"83cf7d844d9f11bd55294bd2b23f12c1bbe7455357968a0709158c2bbecf9d05","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"mod-tome/data/talents/misc/npcs.lua","source":"You are able to perform usually unstealthy actions (attacking, using objects, ...) without breaking stealth.\t When you perform such an action while stealthed, you have a chance to stay hidden.\n\t\tSuccess is more likely against fewer opponents and is determined by comparing %0.2f times your stealth power (currently %d) to the stealth detection (reduced by 10%% per tile distance) of all enemies that have a clear line of sight to you.\n\t\tYour base chance of success is 100%% if you are not directly observed, and good or bad luck may also affect it.\n\t\tYou estimate your current chance to maintain stealth as %0.1f%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target_preimage":"你学会在潜行状态下使用一些通常会打破潜行的技能（如攻击，使用物品……）当你在隐身状态下这么做的时候，你有一定概率不会打破潜行状态。\n\t\t面对的对手越少，成功率越高；你的成功率取决于你潜行强度的%0.2f倍（当前值 %d），以及所有视线能及你的敌人的侦测潜行能力（离你距离每有一格则下降10%%）。\n\t\t当你不在敌人的视野内时，基础成功率为 100%%，这一几率还受你的运气影响。\n\t\t你估计当前成功率为 %0.1f%%。","target_preimage_sha256":"83cf7d844d9f11bd55294bd2b23f12c1bbe7455357968a0709158c2bbecf9d05","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-1da0a9afd2d1888c2099/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-1da0a9afd2d1888c2099","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-1da0a9afd2d1888c2099/manifest.json","observation_identity":"5080e2038651c98e5eff5a730574195d17abb165ee28215a39605666845327c0","publication_commit":"4fca890592dc150df90d82d01985be824de20c42","